ing-relaxed shadow-3xs">Esta é uma citação de teste.</blockquote><div class="my-3 select-text"><div class="space-y-1.5 " style="list-style:none;list-style-type:none"><ul class="list-none space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-[13.5px]" style="list-style:none;list-style-type:none"><li class="leading-relaxed" style="list-style:none;list-style-type:none"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 select-text"><span class="text-black dark:text-white font-bold shrink-0 text-sm align-middle w-5 text-center">•</span><div class="flex-1 select-text">[x] Item de tarefa concluído</div></div></li><li class="leading-relaxed" style="list-style:none;list-style-type:none"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 select-text"><span class="text-black dark:text-white font-bold shrink-0 text-sm align-middle w-5 text-center">•</span><div class="flex-1 select-text">[ ] Item de tarefa pendente</div></div></li></ul></div></div></div>"`;

